flowchart TD
    A([Start scan]) --> B[Read default route and interface]
    B --> C{Raw socket allowed?}
    C -- yes --> D[ARP sweep across the subnet]
    C -- no --> E[ICMP ping sweep]
    E --> F[Read kernel neighbour table]
    D --> G[Reverse DNS + DHCP lease names]
    F --> G
    G --> H[OUI lookup and merge into inventory]
    H --> I{Device selected}

    I --> J{Block or unblock?}
    J -- block --> K{Target is gateway or own MAC?}
    K -- yes --> L[[Refuse unless force=true]]
    K -- no --> M[Install tagged iptables rules<br/>MAC drop + IP drop]
    M --> N{This host is the gateway?}
    N -- yes --> O[FORWARD chain covers the whole LAN]
    N -- no --> P[ARP reply: gateway lives at our MAC]
    P --> Q[Refresh every 2 s, restore on unblock]
    M --> R[Record block + audit event]
    O --> R
    Q --> R

    J -- unblock --> S[Stop interception, restore ARP]
    S --> T[Delete CUTOFF-tagged rules]
    T --> U[Clear inventory block + audit event]

    J -- cut wifi --> V{hostapd or monitor adapter?}
    V -- yes --> W[Deauthenticate client]
    V -- no --> X[[Report unavailable; Block remains the fallback]]
